Native NFC SELECT/exchange framing is adapted from My Signet HandshakeApdu,
aa663efb2455f8430538866c231ed58f1ee8c0f7. Coarse optical frames/Base45 assembly
is adapted from handshake-optical.ts at 335e1f6615f7db6fbcd8b5b5dfa9fdb6d0113667,
with a separate Vouch payload/domain and bounded public/encrypted packet types.

